Feature: Sales Invoice   
   
Scenario: Edit Sales Invoice
    Given we visit "orders/salesInvoice"   
    When we clear the from date and search
    And we edit the top row
    Then the following fields should not be empty:
    | field                               |
    | orders_model_date_purchased         |
    | orders_model_customers_id           |
    | orders_model_sGodownId              |
    | orders_model_trDate                 |